      "message": "Condense all 28 skills to reduce context usage (~30%) (#3)\n\nCut boilerplate without losing operational content: known enumerations\n(atomic-design taxonomy, 80-line tokens.css example), verbose Summarize\nphases, repeated identify-the-surface preambles, and redundant\njustifications.\n\nPreserved intact: WCAG thresholds and concrete values, coverage-first\nreview instructions (claude/), the warm-editorial house-style guard,\nmake-tweakable's host protocol, tool references, and all skill triggers.\nThe claude/codex divergences are kept; the four shared files remain\nbyte-identical across variants.\n\nAlso fixes two stale \"Wait for all four agents\" phrasings in codex\npolish-pass and hierarchy-rhythm-review, which contradicted that\nvariant's sequential-pass framing.",
